        "text": "```python\ndef merge(intervals):\n    if not intervals:\n        return []\n\n    intervals = sorted(intervals, key=lambda x: x[0])\n    res = [intervals[0]]\n\n    for curr in intervals[1:]:\n        last = res[-1]\n        if curr[0] <= last[1]:\n            last = [last[0], max(last[1], curr[1])]\n            res[-1] = last\n        else:\n            res.append(curr)\n\n    return res\n```",
